exports[`en-US output is unchanged > internal_plan matches the pre-locale snapshot 2`] = `
{
  "bodyMd": "# Internal plan: Fill verified West capacity

## Evidence (from saved metrics)
- **Verified direct h/wk available**: 46 (as of 2026-10-15; metric \`verified_weekly_direct_hours_available\`)
- **Inquiries vs peer median**: 8 / 20 (last 30 days; metric \`inquiries\`)

## Explanation
West has verified unbooked hours.

## Proposed action
Share the factual referral packet with partners.

## Guardrail
Pause if verified capacity drops.

## Measurement
- Hypothesis: A factual packet increases verified starts.
- Primary metric: \`care_starts\` on the CareFlow dashboard
- Guardrails: \`median_first_response\`, \`close_without_resolution\`

## Review checklist
- [ ] Operations confirmed current verified capacity (46 direct h/wk as of 2026-10-15)
- [ ] Payer details verified within policy
- [ ] No family-level data used or shared
- [ ] Owner and review date assigned

## Halt conditions
- Verified capacity drops below the mission threshold
- Median first response time worsens beyond SLA
- Close-without-resolution rate increases
",
  "title": "Internal growth plan — Fill verified West capacity",
}
`;

exports[`en-US output is unchanged > partner_packet matches the pre-locale snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "bodyMd": "# Referral information for professional partners
**Harbor Behavioral Services (DEMO) · West Center**
200 Demo Way, Harbor Bay (DEMO), DM 00105

## Service area
We serve families within approximately 11 miles of the center (service-area ZCTAs: 00101, 00105, 00106).

## Services at this location
- Center-based, Telehealth (if applicable)
- Practice policy: ages 2–16 (confirm with intake).

## Insurance plans
- Cascade Commercial (DEMO) — participation verified by staff on 2026-10-01
- Meridian Medicaid Plan (DEMO) — participation verified by staff on 2026-10-01

Plan participation is listed as recorded by our staff and is **subject to verification**. It does not confirm any individual family's coverage, benefits, or authorization.

## How to refer
- Share our intake contact with the family, or have the family contact us directly.
- **Do not send diagnoses, records, or insurance details by regular email or fax cover notes.** Our intake team will provide a secure channel.
- Optional: families may mention referral code **BAYPEDS** so we can count referrals in aggregate. We never share an individual family's status with referring partners.

## What happens next
Our intake team contacts the family, reviews scheduling preferences, and our staff verify benefits and any required authorization. We do not quote wait times or promise start dates in advance.

## Intake contact
- Phone: 555-0101 (demo)
- Email: west@harbor.demo

_We do not offer gifts, payments, or anything of value for referrals._
",
  "title": "Professional referral information — West Center",
}
`;

