  "bodyMd": "**Subject:** Referral information for West Center

Hello Bayview Pediatrics Group (DEMO) team,

I'm reaching out from Harbor Behavioral Services (DEMO) to share up-to-date information about ABA services at West Center (Harbor Bay (DEMO), DM). We'd welcome the chance to be a resource for families you work with.

- Services: Center-based, Telehealth (if applicable)
- Service area: about 11 miles around the center
- Plans with staff-verified participation: Cascade Commercial (DEMO), Meridian Medicaid Plan (DEMO) (subject to verification of each family's benefits)

Our one-page referral sheet is attached for your reference. Please don't include patient details in email; families can contact our intake team directly at 555-0101 (demo).

Thank you,
[Staff name], Harbor Behavioral Services (DEMO)

_DRAFT — requires human review. Sending is disabled in this demo._
",
  "title": "Draft introduction email — West Center",
}
